              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 24,
                "start": 24
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to MR. KOCH, citing Bailey, the petitioner argues that merely receiving and holding the gun does not constitute \u201cuse.\u201d"
        }
      ],
