              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 26,
                "start": 26
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to MS. MAYNARD, receiving the firearm as payment is a \u201cuse\u201d of the firearm in furtherance of a drug\u2011trafficking crime."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Ms. Maynard",
          "citations": [
